### Found case: exact product
POST http://localhost:3000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How much is the Anker PowerCore 20000mAh?" }

### Found case: brand query
POST http://localhost:3000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Do you have any Baseus products?" }

### Found case: warranty lookup
POST http://localhost:3000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is the warranty on the Amazfit Bip 5?" }

### Found case: with debug scores
POST http://localhost:3000/ask?debug=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Is the Soundcore Life P3 in stock?" }

### Not available: product category not stocked
POST http://localhost:3000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Do you sell washing machines?" }

### Not available: product not in catalogue
POST http://localhost:3000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How much is the iPhone 17 Pro Max?" }

### Not available: unrelated question
POST http://localhost:3000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is your return policy?" }

### Tricky: misspelled but real product
POST http://localhost:3000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "powerbnk anker 20000" }

### Tricky: stocked brand, unstocked model
POST http://localhost:3000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Do you have the Baseus Bowie D99?" }

### Validation: empty question should 400
POST http://localhost:3000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "" }
